<p>The <strong class="selflink">background.xls</strong> file contains the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/2DA" title="2da">2da</a> files that define the standard backgrounds and determine which are available to each combination of race and class.
</p><p>The workbook contains the following worksheets:
</p>
<ul><li> <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Backgrounds%202da" title="Backgrounds 2da">Backgrounds</a></li>
<li> <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Background%20desc%202da" title="Background desc 2da">background_desc</a></li>
<li> <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Background%20names%202da" title="Background names 2da">background_names</a></li>
<li> <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Background%20icons%202da" title="Background icons 2da">background_icons</a></li>
<li> _old</li>
<li> _old_equipment</li>
<li> <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Background%20defaults%202da" title="Background defaults 2da">background_defaults</a></li>
<li> <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Chargen%20preload%202da" title="Chargen preload 2da">chargen_preload</a></li></ul>
